Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Bravery: close the current tab from the bottom-left
 toolbar button

The bottom toolbar's home/new-tab button becomes a close-tab button,
using the same call as the "Close tab" menu item (undo snackbar included).
---
 .../bottom/BottomToolbarCoordinator.java      | 36 +++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

